    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hue, Pulse is a unique rhythm-fighting game hybrid played on an isometric grid. Battles can be 1v1, 2v2, and 1v2. Each character adheres to a certain meter - either 3,4,5, or 7 - and must perform its actions on its meter. Combine characters to form your unique team!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hue, Pulse is a unique rhythm-fighting game hybrid played on an isometric grid. Battles can be 1v1, 2v2, and 1v2. Each character adheres to a certain meter - either 3,4,5, or 7 - and must perform its actions on its meter. Combine characters to form your unique team!</p>",
